  ("Who do I call for emergency HVAC in Newmarket on a weekend?", "Call us at 1-647-694-5845, because we take emergency calls in Newmarket evenings, weekends and holidays. We ask a few quick questions about the furnace and give you a realistic timeline."),
  ("Is it worth fixing a furnace that's 15 to 20 years old?", "Sometimes, depending on what failed. A new ignitor or flame sensor is usually worth it, while a cracked heat exchanger or a failed inducer on an older mid-efficiency unit often is not, so we price both options for you."),
  ("How often does a furnace need a tune-up?", "Once a year, ideally in early fall before the heating season starts. A tune-up checks the burners, flame sensor, venting, condensate drain and safety switches, and most manufacturers expect it to keep the warranty valid."),
